#: scenario7:scenario7_19C8A4BC_99C1_487D_8145_8D0EA7C19F58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d8abfe8c352304e4a628f86642a0784f19d7b0b7cb3ea2c849fb9ad01d9ddd9
#. default-sha256: c72b6bbfabb25cb7e4218c93369ad53f601f79362073713f663ebe00e26edaf5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_19C8A4BC_99C1_487D_8145_8D0EA7C19F58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After being pierced by Didier’s blade,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I found myself looking down upon my own "
"corpse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Depois de ser perfurado pela lâmina de Didier,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫eu me vi olhando para o meu próprio "
"cadáver."

#: scenario7:scenario7_80A15A9D_1B5F_42D0_A41D_B1D1F2177CA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1afba2820e2d02d796edf843347bbddc96fb0d5c63192f89824c533e30600c46
#. default-sha256: c7bd8f946d0844802bc6c7016981fd26e1bd329d4a45d0cfb037e077de550ef1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_80A15A9D_1B5F_42D0_A41D_B1D1F2177CA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I watched as my eldest brother dragged me to the place of my crucifixion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu observei enquanto meu irmão mais velho me arrastava para o local da minha crucificação."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6BA73D07_65B7_4AFD_884C_81E2F012DF25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d72bf6074df734e9a5ef5940bbb5e8c50d502165264fe488d44583d43f468f5
#. default-sha256: 7018a332c2cdea01b02afed518eaa53678e878e08337e317762112d06dd6a015
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6BA73D07_65B7_4AFD_884C_81E2F012DF25"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The knights!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Os cavaleiros!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8B7324EA_75E9_434E_B1E0_E73B255130B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ad4cf71ce6fb2792663d0bebc9a1b1fe18058dd99cf6ba75151e070133d8354
#. default-sha256: 2e947bc7e1393eb4b4e406b07fe543db6c6a0bbb82870a65affc613c580767a7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8B7324EA_75E9_434E_B1E0_E73B255130B5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The men who had come to ransack the mansion were standing there, staring at my body in awe."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Os homens que vieram saquear a mansão estavam ali, olhando para meu corpo com admiração."

#: scenario7:scenario7_ED90C3D4_9453_4321_A580_7F1D34EEEF7D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea6fd6bb9324de6004ea6990109f8bf9e2271cab620472c363b477a68a10477f
#. default-sha256: cc62ccbf126e5dc572e3198237a25323fdbce9af079d38828f23df28465f45e1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ED90C3D4_9453_4321_A580_7F1D34EEEF7D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahh, the Lord’s judgment has been delivered unto the witch of the cursed mansion by His holy "
"servants."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahh, o julgamento do Senhor foi entregue à bruxa da mansão amaldiçoada por Seus santos "
"servos."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A1A1486_1AC2_4F6B_93BF_65F63A063C83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7731a7bd89f1c7d353ca6d4883ac7b369ede7c3ec40220d9a15694b40f98e752
#. default-sha256: 7d6207e7f61332e6ca9f685b832faa209f3bf5de435963f17ebc21b59a1f65ee
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A1A1486_1AC2_4F6B_93BF_65F63A063C83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We have assembled all the tools you need to execute your divine mission. ⟪k:1⟫A cross, "
"befitting of such a heinous sinner!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Reunimos todas as ferramentas de que você precisa para executar sua missão divina. ⟪k:1⟫Uma "
"cruz, digna de uma pecadora tão hedionda!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_71CEAC7F_E583_49D1_AD46_B531CE5EA92D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2f0e73e6f7622d0e744ad2baad4c2c5562176cec213917fe4abe6131a21bd00
#. default-sha256: bd6eab362b888911cc461ceafbf6f3df1fcc4203b46651320cddfe8c431f4bb9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_71CEAC7F_E583_49D1_AD46_B531CE5EA92D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That witch threatened to curse us!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sullied our pure ears with its blasphemy!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Essa bruxa ameaçou nos amaldiçoar!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Manchou nossos ouvidos puros com sua blasfêmia!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C92DCB1B_C140_4C09_A9F4_4E152AD3CBD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06831e967f1fa540262817d1a02a1801c8819225da52aea2ebbd2044be8e1d17
#. default-sha256: 061582a242d09ff97edf8c4002357c8c69cd876db97b0ebf7fd09938812359a1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C92DCB1B_C140_4C09_A9F4_4E152AD3CBD0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had done no such thing...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I hadn’t cursed anyone.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I had merely been "
"defending myself..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu não tinha feito nada disso...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu não amaldiçoei ninguém.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu estava "
"apenas me defendendo..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_01CDD73C_7009_4BF2_A713_A9D75E21BF1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f8f4034ea93336b04aa6f2d93e70ee24ad665353a0eb1d07a4628356617e3cc
#. default-sha256: a08dc08eabc4455f60d4dcf64db925cb73b64673f88251ce92cca6b9fdaf414f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_01CDD73C_7009_4BF2_A713_A9D75E21BF1C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They had been armed and outnumbered me...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫so I had said what was necessary to chase "
"them off."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eles estavam armados e em maior número do que eu...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫então eu disse o que era "
"necessário para afugentá-los. "

#: scenario7:scenario7_9F09D42E_C560_4E6C_85CC_E1446F093B6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4050e0bdfc0e5d8483b34b698c52ca09a0527e883cdbf64afe7d2227987c53e5
#. default-sha256: ffba2cd32193fc082344f33c442d4381ae48bd8f0c183e6d486bc44483da1ee7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9F09D42E_C560_4E6C_85CC_E1446F093B6E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Our poor harvest and our suffering at the hands of the greedy lord were all the work of the "
"witch!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nossa colheita ruim e nosso sofrimento nas mãos do senhor ganancioso foram tudo obra da "
"bruxa!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_95CFA38E_6A0D_45D8_AC57_B18FBA96D197
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 148d882a7944cf1919ebbdeb82cdcc20f01412589399a4a1f2f369987cf7f0bf
#. default-sha256: 439ff6f21b601dc263b99e74cba74963dcf33ba30c47f614813c5ba5cb8db5ba
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_95CFA38E_6A0D_45D8_AC57_B18FBA96D197"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I prayed. ⟪k:1⟫I asked God to grant me the smallest of miracles."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Então eu rezei. ⟪k:1⟫Pedi a Deus que me concedesse o menor dos milagres."

#: scenario7:scenario7_033A2315_AC2C_41C2_8315_A7996EA3E827
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 887f80ec04cc6b64222315d15bc5515793d1ea1aa874e02d536df4a302c2e087
#. default-sha256: 10bc99aaf59f1d0c73dbd545d26b1b7695ec844b82a1e45ff56c1d8f07b6c002
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_033A2315_AC2C_41C2_8315_A7996EA3E827"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To let my voice reach my brother, who carried my body."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Para deixar minha voz chegar ao meu irmão, que carregava meu corpo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3862AE0C_464A_4525_8ECB_6E3291ABEB35
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67fd23e1ad9b4b12c710226f624827af77eb75ae5cb90d7864cee251c3da44a8
#. default-sha256: 037c2ad3ba1c021cde5fc37a06b0926095059788b07d5dca6f54716262c15311
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3862AE0C_464A_4525_8ECB_6E3291ABEB35"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You know me better than that...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You know I’ve done nothing wrong..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Você me conhece melhor do que isso...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Você sabe que não fiz nada de errado..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D009FECC_2960_47A6_8DA6_F92E9871462F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 992bda7ffd3f3cb11aaf6f2fa6bc7d3a11328e7aaeedfcd0ae10f4825a6c8600
#. default-sha256: 059628badc845f8c5f4db6d631cec57dd28497bed2b4fa58af8e040929a3ffb9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D009FECC_2960_47A6_8DA6_F92E9871462F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Those men smirking at the sight of my body...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫they’re the ones putting the blame "
"for their sins on me..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Aqueles homens sorrindo ao ver meu corpo...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫são eles que colocam a culpa dos seus "
"pecados em mim..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_00B923A4_C9C9_4378_986A_F8838E238D0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 543e0aa021f1f42dfe2f0845db9af99281eec10c2349e12e40d9786450b42ae9
