msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why do you say nothing?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Por que você não diz nada?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_EA47D360_0BC7_473A_B649_CFC04349B927
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08f7d79e9e3b2271917545fdc461b618e8a809b0314534f19439242f554dacf3
