msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why do you accept the tools this man presents you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Por que você aceita as ferramentas que este homem lhe traz—"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E6DB3BE6_2FD3_48F8_9DB3_67C9E599D0B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43f2b05a313762e68b6626f7db3d1954e97265137de46c2959ab395894438ce1
